cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper and identify the revision used."
title: "Hadamard matrices of orders 5164 and 8332 from real weighing matrices"
version: "0.1.0-dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/hadamard-orders-5164-and-8332"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - Hadamard matrices
  - weighing matrices
  - Golay pairs
abstract: >-
  A real weighing matrix of order q+3 and weight q+1 gives an ordinary
  Hadamard matrix of order 4(q+2) whenever q is prime and congruent to 1
  modulo 4. Two known weighing matrices give orders 5164 and 8332,
  listed as open in the 2026 survey by Egan, Kotsireas, London and Ó Catháin
  (arXiv:2610.27175v2). Historical priority remains
  provisional.
